@startuml Preciazo_Community_Verification_States
title Preciazo - Price Discrepancy Lifecycle (AV2 Proposal)
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
state "Initial anomaly screening" as Screening <<choice>>
[*] --> Screening : Report Price Discrepancy
Screening --> OPEN : No anomaly
Screening --> UNDER_REVIEW : Anomaly or missing rule
OPEN --> OPEN : Valid community vote
OPEN --> UNDER_REVIEW : Policy: REVIEW
OPEN --> ACCEPTED : Policy: ACCEPT
OPEN --> REJECTED : Policy: REJECT
UNDER_REVIEW --> ACCEPTED : Reviewer: ACCEPT
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : Reviewer: REJECT
ACCEPTED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]
note right of Screening
  Creation and screening share one transaction.
  No intermediate OPEN report is visible to buyers.
end note
note bottom of OPEN
  Missing confidence or resolution rule: keep OPEN.
  A negative vote alone does not reject a report.
  Invalid and duplicate requests do not change state.
end note
note bottom of UNDER_REVIEW
  Community voting is blocked while held.
  Reviewer decisions require a permission and a reason.
  Reviewer permission uses existing IAM permissions;
  no new role or ACL is introduced.
  Acceptance and rejection are final in this scope.
end note
@enduml
